==Description==
The '''Ducky Revenge Event''' was the twenty-second event to be added in Tower Defense Simulator. The event was released on the 16th of April 2025 in 17:00 UTC and ended on the 28th of May 2025 in 19:00 UTC.

It was released with the '''Ducky Revenge Battle Pass''', which ended two weeks after the event.

==Ducky Revenge Battle Pass==
[[File:DuckyRevengeBattlePass.png|center|450px]]
{{DuckyEggs|Ducky Eggs}} were the currency used for the '''Ducky Revenge Event Battle Pass''', which could have been collected from enemies. These enemies dropped between one and three {{DuckyEggs|Ducky Eggs}} on death and could have been collected by walking near them. These currency drops did not give one {{DuckyEggs|Ducky Egg}} each. The number varied based on the mode played.

